  "name": "WNT–β-catenin",
  "category": "signaling",
  "topic": "signaling",
  "summary": "Without WNT, a destruction complex continuously phosphorylates β-catenin for degradation. WNT binding to Frizzled/LRP6 inhibits the complex, so β-catenin accumulates, enters the nucleus and activates TCF/LEF target genes.",
